{
  "name": "Content Factory — Таблица Мечты",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "hook": null,
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": { "parameters": { "hook": { "label": "Content Factory Webhook" } } },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "hook",
            "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
            "label": "Webhook",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "status": "200",
        "body": "<script>window.close();</script>",
        "headers": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "airtable:ActionGetRecord",
      "version": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      },
      "mapper": {
        "base": "",
        "typecast": false,
        "table": "",
        "id": "{{1.record_id}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:airtable2",
            "label": "Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 }
      },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 10,
              "module": "apify:RunActor",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "actorId": "",
                "input": "{\"usernames\": [\"{{3.fields.`Ник Инстаграма`}}\"], \"resultsLimit\": {{3.fields.`Количество`}}}",
                "build": "latest",
                "memory": 4096,
                "timeout": 300,
                "synchronous": true
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": -600 },
                "expect": [
                  { "name": "actorId", "type": "text", "label": "Actor", "required": true },
                  { "name": "input", "type": "text", "label": "Input JSON" },
                  { "name": "synchronous", "type": "boolean", "label": "Wait for completion" }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:apify",
                    "label": "Apify Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: Анализ (Start)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "start",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 11,
              "module": "apify:GetDatasetItems",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "datasetId": "{{10.defaultDatasetId}}",
                "clean": true,
                "limit": ""
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": -600 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 12,
              "module": "airtable:ActionCreateRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "record": {
                  "Ник Инстаграма": "{{11.ownerUsername}}",
                  "Ссылка на видео": "{{11.url}}",
                  "Preview": [{ "url": "{{11.displayUrl}}" }],
                  "Медиа": [{ "url": "{{11.videoUrl}}" }],
                  "Просмотры": "{{11.videoViewCount}}",
                  "Лайки": "{{11.likesCount}}",
                  "Описание видео": "{{11.caption}}",
                  "Комментарии": "{{11.commentsCount}}",
                  "Когда добавлено": "{{11.timestamp}}"
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": -600 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 20,
              "module": "http:ActionGetFile",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "url": "{{3.fields.`Медиа`}}",
                "shareCookies": false
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": -300 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: Транскрибация (Trans)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "trans",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 21,
              "module": "assemblyai:UploadFile",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "data": "{{20.data}}",
                "fileName": "{{20.fileName}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": -300 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:assemblyai",
                    "label": "AssemblyAI Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 22,
              "module": "assemblyai:TranscribeAudio",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "audio_url": "{{21.upload_url}}",
                "language_detection": true,
                "punctuate": true,
                "format_text": true
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": -300 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 23,
              "module": "airtable:ActionUpdateRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "id": "{{3.id}}",
                "record": {
                  "Транскриптер": "{{22.text}}"
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": -300 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 30,
              "module": "util:SetVariables",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "variables": [
                  {
                    "name": "assistant_id",
                    "value": "{{switch(3.fields.`Выбор`; \"Перевод\"; \"asst_YOUR_TRANSLATE_ID\"; \"10 заголовков\"; \"asst_YOUR_HEADLINES_ID\"; \"Больше материала\"; \"asst_YOUR_MORE_MATERIAL_ID\"; \"asst_YOUR_DEFAULT_ID\")}}"
                  }
                ],
                "scope": "roundtrip"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 0 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: ChatGPT (GPT)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "gpt",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 31,
              "module": "openai-gpt-4:MessageAnAssistant",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "assistantId": "{{30.assistant_id}}",
                "role": "user",
                "message": "{{3.fields.`Транскриптер`}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 0 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:openai-gpt-4",
                    "label": "OpenAI Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 32,
              "module": "airtable:ActionUpdateRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "id": "{{3.id}}",
                "record": {
                  "Результат ГПТ": "{{31.message}}"
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 0 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 40,
              "module": "airtable:ActionGetRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "id": "{{1.record_id}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 300 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: Озвучка 11Labs (Lab)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "lab",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 41,
              "module": "elevenlabs:TextToSpeech",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "voiceId": "",
                "modelId": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
                "text": "{{40.fields.`Готовый результат`}}",
                "stability": 1,
                "similarity_boost": 1
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 300 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:elevenlabs",
                    "label": "11 Labs Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 42,
              "module": "google-drive:UploadFile",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "folderId": "",
                "name": "voiceover_{{now}}.mp3",
                "data": "{{41.data}}",
                "convert": false
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 300 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:google",
                    "label": "Google Drive Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 43,
              "module": "google-drive:ShareFile",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "fileId": "{{42.id}}",
                "type": "anyone",
                "role": "reader"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": 300 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 44,
              "module": "airtable:ActionUpdateRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "id": "{{1.record_id}}",
                "record": {
                  "Озвучка": [
                    {
                      "url": "{{43.webContentLink}}",
                      "filename": "{{42.name}}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2400, "y": 300 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 50,
              "module": "airtable:ActionGetRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "id": "{{1.record_id}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 600 }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Route: HeyGen Аватар (Gen)",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.button}}",
                      "b": "gen",
                      "o": "text:equal"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 51,
              "module": "heygen:CreateAvatarVideo",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "avatar_id": "",
                "voice_type": "audio",
                "audio_url": "{{50.fields.`Озвучка`}}",
                "caption": false,
                "scale": 1
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 600 },
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "__IMTCONN__",
                    "type": "account:heygen",
                    "label": "HeyGen Connection",
                    "required": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 52,
              "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "delay": 300
              },
              "mapper": {},
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 600 },
                "note": "Sleep 300 секунд — ожидание генерации аватара"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 53,
              "module": "heygen:GetVideo",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "video_id": "{{51.video_id}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": 600 }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 54,
              "module": "airtable:ActionUpdateRecord",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": null
              },
              "mapper": {
                "base": "",
                "typecast": false,
                "table": "",
                "id": "{{1.record_id}}",
                "record": {
                  "HeyGen результат": [
                    {
                      "url": "{{53.video_url}}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 2400, "y": 600 }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "slots": null,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    },
    "zone": "eu2.make.com",
    "notes": [
      "=== CONTENT FACTORY BLUEPRINT ===",
      "",
      "СТРУКТУРА:",
      "Webhook → Webhook Response → Airtable Get Record → Router (5 маршрутов)",
      "",
      "МАРШРУТЫ:",
      "1. START  — Apify (Instagram Reel Scraper) → Airtable Create Record",
      "2. TRANS  — HTTP Get File → AssemblyAI Upload + Transcribe → Airtable Update",
      "3. GPT    — Set Variables (выбор ассистента) → OpenAI Assistant → Airtable Update",
      "4. LAB    — 11 Labs TTS → Google Drive Upload + Share → Airtable Update",
      "5. GEN    — HeyGen Create Avatar → Sleep 300s → HeyGen Get Video → Airtable Update",
      "",
      "НАСТРОЙКА:",
      "1. Создать Webhook и скопировать URL в формулу кнопки Airtable",
      "2. Подключить аккаунты: Airtable, Apify, AssemblyAI, OpenAI, 11 Labs, Google Drive, HeyGen",
      "3. Указать Base ID и Table ID в каждом модуле Airtable",
      "4. В модуле Apify указать Actor ID для Instagram Reel Scraper",
      "5. В модуле Set Variables заменить asst_YOUR_*_ID на реальные ID ассистентов OpenAI",
      "6. В модуле 11 Labs выбрать Voice ID",
      "7. В модуле Google Drive указать Folder ID",
      "8. В модуле HeyGen указать Avatar ID",
      "",
      "КОЛОНКИ AIRTABLE:",
      "- Ник Инстаграма (text)",
      "- Количество (number)",
      "- Запуск (button, value=start)",
      "- Ссылка на видео (url)",
      "- Preview (attachment)",
      "- Медиа (attachment)",
      "- Просмотры (number, integer)",
      "- Лайки (number, integer)",
      "- Описание видео (long text)",
      "- Сколько дней назад (formula)",
      "- Комментарии (number, integer)",
      "- Когда добавлено (date)",
      "- В работу (select: Статус/В работу/Черновик)",
      "- Транскрибация (button, value=trans)",
      "- Транскриптер (long text)",
      "- Выбор (select: Перевод/10 заголовков/Больше материала)",
      "- ChatGPT (button, value=gpt)",
      "- Результат ГПТ (long text)",
      "- Готовый результат (long text)",
      "- 11 Labs (button, value=lab)",
      "- Озвучка (attachment)",
      "- HeyGen (button, value=gen)",
      "- HeyGen результат (attachment)"
    ]
  }
}
